'''Relay Base''' is an [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[River City Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Relay Base
|image = E 657.png
|first appearance = [[River City Stages]]
